WEBVTT

1
00:00:00,750 --> 00:00:04,030
When I first went to Taixue University

2
00:00:04,030 --> 00:00:06,030
If only I could study for a few more days

3
00:00:06,030 --> 00:00:08,100
It won't be like this if you can't say it

4
00:00:08,100 --> 00:00:09,100
Brother Fang

5
00:00:09,100 --> 00:00:18,530
You came to me, brother

6
00:00:18,530 --> 00:00:19,530
Brother misses you so much

7
00:00:19,530 --> 00:00:20,530
Brother Fang

8
00:00:20,530 --> 00:00:22,530
I miss you too

9
00:00:23,530 --> 00:00:24,530
how are you these days

10
00:00:24,530 --> 00:00:26,490
Not so good

11
00:00:26,490 --> 00:00:27,490
after what happened last time

12
00:00:27,490 --> 00:00:30,520
My dad hugged me and beat me up, right?

13
00:00:30,520 --> 00:00:31,520
What happened last time

14
00:00:31,520 --> 00:00:32,520
Have you beaten me yet?

15
00:00:32,520 --> 00:00:33,520
I ran up the tree

16
00:00:33,520 --> 00:00:36,710
My dad didn't go up, brother

17
00:00:36,710 --> 00:00:37,710
don't want to get beaten

18
00:00:37,710 --> 00:00:39,900
Running is not an option

19
00:00:39,900 --> 00:00:41,900
We have to get something done

20
00:00:41,900 --> 00:00:44,290
Big brother comes to see you this time

21
00:00:44,290 --> 00:00:48,470
It’s to conspire with you, big brother

22
00:00:48,470 --> 00:00:49,470
what do you want to do

23
00:00:49,470 --> 00:00:51,470
You can't do anything rebellious.

24
00:00:51,470 --> 00:00:52,790
What words

25
00:00:52,790 --> 00:00:56,990
Brother Fang

26
00:00:56,990 --> 00:00:57,990
As long as it's not rebellion

27
00:00:57,990 --> 00:00:58,990
It’s easy to say anything

28
00:00:58,990 --> 00:01:00,990
You tell me this time

29
00:01:00,990 --> 00:01:01,990
Whose gourd are you peeing in?
